  "description": "QEHBOX crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C176 H152 Nd4 O23,3(C4 H8 O1). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd3 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors; Nd4 (Nd) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.867-4.271 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 83.61-129.31°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C188H176Nd4O26.",
